body:"The elevation model, orthophoto, LoD2 buildings and vegetation run to several dozen megabytes and are deliberately not committed. The pipeline fetches them from the official sources and builds the render assets. Until then the scene shows only sky, a reference plane and the resolved places.",note:"The command is repeatable: tiles already downloaded are reused rather than fetched again."},Yw={heading:"Analysis",pending:"from phase {{phase}}",noRooms:"No indoor data exists for this site, so the buildings stay closed. No rooms are invented to fill the gap.",occupancy:{label:"Rooms",blurb:"How well used are the lecture halls and labs? Occupancy from the planned timetable — buildings open up floor by floor."},condition:{label:"Maintenance backlog & investment",blurb:"Condition grades, refurbishment need and investment scenarios to 2040."},flow:{label:"Campus flow",blurb:"Movement between lectures, derived from the real timetable."},staffing:{label:"Lecturers",blurb:"Who is carrying this plan? Planned contact hours against each contract."},quality:{label:"Students",blurb:"What does their day look like? Idle gaps, day length, campus changes and fringe hours."},intro:"The same week from three angles — depending on whom the question is about."},Kw={intro:"A plan can be conflict-free and still unpleasant. This is what the day looks like for students — measured over the lectures a student group attends in full.",idleBlocks:"Idle blocks",daysWithGap:"Days with a gap",longestDay:"Longest day",campusChanges:"Campus changes",blocks:"{{n}} blocks",tightGood:"No transfer is too tight: every campus change leaves enough break for the walk.",tightBad:"{{n}} transfers are too tight — the walk takes longer than the break.",unpopular:"Fringe hours",unpopularCount:"{{n}} sessions sit in the least popular slots (desirability ≤ {{threshold}}).",worstCohorts:"Most affected",worstBlurb:"Ranked by students kept waiting, not by number of student groups. Selecting one opens that student group's week.",cohortDetail:"{{days}} of {{total}} days with a gap · {{head}} students",limitation:"Measured per whole-group lecture, not per student: the dataset knows group sizes but not who is in which group. What was checked instead is that no group ever clashes with its own student group's lectures ({{combos}} combinations, 0 collisions). The student-to-group mapping is what an Untis export supplies.",noData:"No plan quality has been computed for this site yet. tools/data/build_plan_quality.py derives it from the generated timetable.",synthetic:"The timetable is synthetic. The day shapes are genuinely derived from it, but they describe an invented plan."},Zw={intro:"A timetable assigns rooms and hours — but it also assigns teaching to people. This is how much each lecturer actually carries, measured against their contract.",total:"Total teaching load",ofContract:"{{planned}} of {{contract}} contact hours",courses:"{{n}} courses",spread:"{{over}} over contract, {{idle}} with no teaching — out of {{total}} lecturers.",overHeading:"Over contract",overBlurb:"These assignments exceed the agreed load. Selecting one opens that week and lights their rooms in the model.",idleHeading:"No teaching assigned",idleBlurb:"Contracted teaching capacity this plan does not use.",byFaculty:"By faculty",overShort:"{{n}} over contract",noQuota:"The professorial quota is deliberately not shown: every lecturer in this dataset is a professor, so the figure would be 100% by construction and would measure nothing. It needs adjunct and research staff modelled in the generator first.",noData:"No teaching load has been computed for this site yet. tools/data/build_staffing.py derives it from the generated timetable.",synthetic:"The timetable is synthetic. The teaching-load figures are genuinely derived from it, but they describe an invented plan."},Qw={measured:"measured",derived:"derived",synthetic:"synthetic"},Jw={pickBuilding:"Choose a building — click it in the model, or pick one here. Its 